<title>USA: Jardine sets lower net investment payout.</title>
<headline>Jardine sets lower net investment payout.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Fleming China Region Fund Inc said on Tuesday it declared a per-share dividend of $0.02 from net investment income, payable on December 30 to stockholders of record on December 18.</p>
<p>In December 1995 the company paid a per share dividend of $0.07 from net investment income.</p>
